<title>USA: Accent Software names Oseth president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Accent Software names Oseth president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accent Software International Ltd said Wednesday it had named Todd Oseth president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Oseth most recently was vice president of business development for Sony Corp's Information Technologies of America unit.</p>
<p>Accent said Oseth succeeds Robert Rosenschein, the company's founder, who will now serve as co-chairman.</p>
<p>Accent markets and supports multilingual text-processing, Internet and productivity software. The company is based in Israel.</p>
</text>
